<section class="c2-about" id="about">
  <div class="c2-wrap">
    <p class="c2-label c2-reveal">Who we are</p>
    <h2 class="c2-display c2-about-title c2-reveal c2-d1">
      Makdesi And Associates Lawyers are dedicated to providing friendly,
      experienced guidance — helping you navigate estate planning, probate,
      wills, business and property law with clarity and care.
    </h2>
    <p class="c2-about-copy c2-reveal c2-d2">
      We pride ourselves on getting the results you want, efficiently and
      cost-effectively, whilst building long and lasting relationships with our
      clients. As you experience life’s changes, we’ll be there when you need
      advice.
    </p>
    <a href="#team" class="c2-btn c2-btn-dark c2-reveal c2-d3">
      Meet the Team
      <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .c2-about {
    background: var(--c2-paper);
    color: var(--c2-navy);
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
  }
  .c2-about-title {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    max-width: 52rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.4vw, 2.85rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 550;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .c2-about-copy {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    max-width: 38rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--c2-muted-dark);
  }
  .c2-about .c2-btn {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .c2-btn-dark {
    background: var(--c2-navy);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .c2-btn-dark:hover {
    background: var(--c2-gold);
    color: var(--c2-navy);
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .c2-about {
      padding: 7.5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
